OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment to decide on rejected
OL,4,Abetting shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to open a betting shop inside a
OL,7,Frailway station is heading for a
OL,8,Fgovernment planning appeal after the
OL,9,Fcouncil rejected the plans over fears
OL,10,Fof gambling-related harm.
OL,12,FThe appeal has been lodged against
OL,13,FSunderland City Council's decision to
OL,14,Fblock proposals from gambling company
OL,15,FBoyleSports to open a betting office in
OL,16,Fthe city train station's main business
OL,17,Funit in Market Square.
OL,19,FBoyleSports said the development would
OL,20,Fbe "a significant, positive investment
OL,21,Fin a prominent vacant unit", creating
OL,22,Flocal jobs.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
